        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e7d5a8c9b752423dbdea73225a077613",
      "statement": "The precondition that a stage always overwrites the velocity channels before they are read as rates does not hold on several reachable paths: an empty or entirely disabled stage list, the ZeroMQ connector returning without a reply, and the motion field stage after a mid-run exception — in each case the seeded values reach the apply step, because the component applies the pose regardless of what any stage returned.",
      "evidence": [
